    "text_leads": [
      {
        "key": "contract_assets",
        "label": "Unbilled revenue / contract assets",
        "excerpt": "correlate with revenue recognized over time using the percentage-of-completion method. As a result, we carry contract assets and liabilities in our balance sheet. These contract assets and liabilities are calculated on a contract-by-contract basis and are classified as curr",
